@startuml

actor Author
participant "LaTeX macro\n(\\embedpuml{basename})" as TeX
participant "Lua module\nscripts.embedpuml" as Lua
participant "Shared builder\n(embed_utils.make_builder)" as Builder
participant "PlantUML CLI" as PlantUML
participant "Inkscape" as Inkscape
participant "out/<dir>/<base>.pdf" as PDF

Author -> TeX: Writes command in .tex
TeX -> Lua: directlua calls build(basename)
Lua -> Builder: build(basename)
Builder -> Builder: ensure output dir\ncheck timestamps
Builder -> PlantUML: plantuml -tsvg ...\n(if .puml newer)
PlantUML --> Builder: out/<dir>/<base>.svg
Builder -> Inkscape: convert svg -> pdf\n(if svg newer)
Inkscape --> PDF: write updated PDF
Builder --> TeX: return pdf path
TeX -> TeX: \\includegraphics{...}

@enduml
